      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "The 'Disable' observationModel setting goes further than 'Unregister' by disabling QuantLib observer notifications entirely during market/fixing updates and evaluation-date shifts, relying on explicit recalculation triggers instead, trading automatic dependency tracking for simulation performance; lazyMarketBuilding defers curve construction until first use to avoid building unused curves."
